<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rose to 73.31 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rose to 73.31 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rises to 73.3100 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Wednesday from 73.4855 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				    Dec 11		  Dec 10</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  73.3100		 73.4855</p>
<p>    volume ( $ million)	6.580		   7.450</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom +8 3272 509410</p>
</text>
